      },
      "natural_statement": "For every k>=2 and nonzero r, the formal stationary value of the scaled point action with f_0=f_k=0 equals that of the scaled line cubic action with parameter R=r^2 and k coefficients c_j=-r*f_j (0<=j<k); its point steps are the cyclic adjacent averages of the line steps. No invertibility of the averaging map on arbitrary steps is assumed.",
